        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Activates adjustment clause in contracts; adjusts per-delivery rates; Finance validates; communicates to partners; implements in ERP
Responsible (R): Logistics Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 days + 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2316_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2316_End5" name="Complete">
