      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2316_Annotation6">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-412 (contract-accuracy — links to VS-03); CTL-44 (rate-adjustment integrity); operational: CFO sign-off on the adjustment
Owner: Logistics Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
