        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-412 (ensure controlled execution — Fuel Procurement &amp; Consumption Management (PA-61.1).) | - CTL-412 (BCP/emergency-fuel — links to VS-26); operational: VP Supply Chain post-event review
Owner: Logistics Manager</bpmn:text>
